PRIORITIZE:
1. Preserve exact load-bearing literals verbatim inside `<preserved_facts>...</preserved_facts>`
2. Adapt tracking format to match the actual task type
3. Capture key user requirements and goals
4. Distinguish between completed and pending tasks
5. Keep prose sections concise while never truncating or paraphrasing anchored literals

SKIP: Verbose boilerplate or irrelevant chatter that contains no load-bearing facts

